      "title": "macos-setup.sh: fix build of latest libgcrypt. [skip ci]",
      "message": "macos-setup.sh: fix build of latest libgcrypt. [skip ci]\n\nThe getentropy random number source currently *requirees* the platform\nto have getrandom(), which is a Linux system call, in FIPS mode.  This\ncauses a compile failure on OSes that don't have it.\n\nConfigure \"unix\" as the random number generator, to avoid trying to\ncompile random/rndgetentropy.c.\n",
